flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Track down the senator&#39;s ward, assassinate him, and exfiltrate without being caught."])
 _A1_(["The crew assembles outside the hospital to begin plotting their entry."])
 _A1_1_(["Cat Burglar glances up at the fifth floor, where our intel suggests the senator is being treated."])
 _A1_C1_{"With the floor likely crawling with cops, Cat Burglar attempts to scale a drainpipe."}
 _A1_C1F_["Cat Burglar makes it halfway up before losing her footing and falling to the ground."]
 _A1_C2_{"Assassin gives Cat Burglar a boost to help her make a second attempt."}
 _A1_C2P_["Cat Burglar makes it to a ledge and nimbly edges across to access the window."]
 _A2_(["Stepping into the records room, Cat Burglar starts hunting for useful information."])
 _A2_1_(["Cat Burglar scans the intake board and finds the senator is being treated on the east ward."])
 _A2_2_(["Cat Burglar relays the senator’s location and his upcoming MRI scan to the team."])
 _A2_3_(["To fake an injury, Cleaner empties an irradiated blood bag on Assassin&#39;s thigh."])
 _A2_4_(["Imitator and Cleaner carry Assassin into the emergency room."])
 _A2_5_(["Imitator flags a nurse and tells him Assassin was shot with an irradiated weapon."])
 _A2_6_(["Assassin is helped into a wheelchair and taken to an isolated triage room."])
 _A2_7_(["The nurse asks Imitator and Cleaner to sit outside in the waiting area."])
 _A2_C1_{"Alone with the nurse, Assassin tries to dispatch him quietly with chloroform."}
 _A2_C1F_["The nurse spots Assassin&#39;s intentions and slaps the chloroform from his hand."]
 _A2_C2_{"A struggle ensues, and Assassin tries desperately to choke the nurse out."}
 _A2_C2P_["Assassin grips his neck hard, cutting off blood flow until the nurse collapses."]
 _A3_(["With the nurse knocked out, Assassin peeks out and gestures for the others to join him."])
 _A3_1_(["The nurse is stripped, allowing Imitator to assume his identity."])
 _A3_2_(["Assassin also gets undressed, donning a fresh hospital gown."])
 _A3_3_(["Assassin sits down in a wheelchair, dressed for the part alongside Imitator."])
 _A3_C1_{"Before leaving, Cleaner tries to hide the nurse&#39;s body to clear the crime scene."}
 _A3_C1F_["Cleaner clears out a supply closet and stuffs the nurse inside, but they tumble out."]
 _A3_C2_{"Cleaner looks desperately for another way to hide the nurse&#39;s body."}
 _A3_C2P_["Cleaner removes a low wall vent and pushes the body into the narrow cavity behind."]
 _A4_(["The vent cover is pushed back into place and the crew exits the triage room."])
 _A4_1_(["Nobody bats an eye as the trio heads toward the elevator."])
 _A4_2_(["Upon reaching the fifth floor, the crew is immediately stopped by the police."])
 _A4_3_(["Believing the act, the cops allow the crew to pass down the corridor."])
 _A4_4_(["They rendezvous with Cat Burglar, who now knows where they can acquire some sedatives."])
 _A4_5_(["Cat Burglar tells Cleaner to distract the nurse while she sneaks behind her."])
 _A4_C1_{"Cleaner approaches the nurse&#39;s station with a made-up complaint."}
 _A4_C1P_["Cleaner reports a blood spill in the ward washroom, prompting her to go and investigate."]
 _A5_(["Cat Burglar creeps into the nurse&#39;s station and steals drugs from the medical store."])
 _A5_1_(["Meanwhile, Imitator finds the senator&#39;s chart, taking it to use as a prop."])
 _A5_2_(["Cat Burglar hands Imitator enough sedatives to put down an elephant."])
 _A5_3_(["Imitator returns to Assassin and wheels him toward the senator&#39;s ward."])
 _A5_C1_{"Imitator tries to talk the cops into letting him and Assassin through."}
 _A5_C1F_["The cops refuse Assassin&#39;s entry onto the ward, citing a high-level threat assessment."]
 _A5_4_(["Imitator wheels Assassin into the nearby recovery ward to form a new plan."])
 _C5_(["Assassin plots a power outage, telling Imitator to strike when the lights go out."])
 _C5_1_(["Assassin wheels himself to Cleaner and tells him to cause a blackout."])
 _C5_C1_{"Cleaner sneaks into the office to find the circuit breaker."}
 _C5_C1F_["Cleaner searches behind cabinets and doors, but the breaker is nowhere to be found."]
 _C5_C2_{"Cat Burglar joins Cleaner to hunt for the elusive breaker box."}
 _C5_C2F_["A nurse catches the crew rummaging around in a restricted area and calls for aid."]
 _C5_2_(["Cops burst into the office and subdue the team without hesitation."])
 _C5_3_(["Hearing the noise, Imitator panics and lunges at the senator with his syringe."])
 _C5F_(["Imitator is wrestled away and arrested, the assassination attempt ending in chaos."])
 _A1_C2F_["Cat Burglar reaches the halfway point before losing grip and landing on her back."]
 _A1_C3_{"Cat Burglar dusts off her clothes and asks Cleaner to help."}
 _A1_C3P_["Finally, on the third attempt, Cat Burglar scales the pipe and reaches the ledge."]
 _A4_C1F_["The nurse ignores Cleaner&#39;s report of a blocked toilet and remains at her station."]
 _A4_6_(["Unaware of Cleaner&#39;s failure, Cat Burglar creeps toward the medical storage cabinet."])
 _A4_C2_{"Cat Burglar tries to obtain the anesthetic supplies without being detected."}
 _A4_C2P_["Cat Burglar manages to avoid the nurses and acquire a stash of sedatives."]
 _A5_5_(["Meanwhile, Imitator finds the senator&#39;s chart, taking it to use as a prop."])
 _A5_6_(["Cat Burglar hands Imitator enough sedatives to put down an elephant."])
 _A5_7_(["Cleaner says the toilet blockage was wriggling and alive, drawing her in to investigate."])
 _A5_C1P_["Chart in hand, Imitator says he will prep the senator for MRI once this patient is settled."]
 _A6_(["Imitator and Assassin are frisked before entering, with the sedatives ignored."])
 _A6_1_(["Assassin is wheeled to the bed beside the senator and the privacy curtain is drawn."])
 _A6_2_(["Imitator hands Assassin the syringe and sedatives, before visiting the senator."])
 _A6_3_(["The senator is asleep, so Imitator starts chatting to the cop standing guard."])
 _A6_4_(["Assassin approaches the senator quietly and locates his IV port."])
 _A6_C1_{"Assassin goes to inject the senator with a slow-acting, lethal dose of sedative."}
 _A6_C1F_["The monitor shows the target&#39;s heart rate holding firm, his breathing calm and steady."]
 _A6_C2_{"Realizing he misjudged the dose, Assassin loads a second shot into the syringe."}
 _A6_C2P_["The senator’s breathing relaxes into shallow whispers, his vital signs starting to decline."]
 _A7_(["Assassin returns to his bed, the senator now moments from death."])
 _A7_1_(["Assassin calls out to Imitator, claiming his stitches have burst open."])
 _A7_2_(["Imitator feigns frustration and collects Assassin in the wheelchair."])
 _A7_3_(["Imitator wheels Assassin to the elevator, closely followed by Cleaner."])
 _A7_4_(["As the doors close, a nurse slips through at the last minute."])
 _A7_5_(["She immediately questions Imitator&#39;s identity, realizing he&#39;s an impostor."])
 _A7_C1_{"Assassin and Cleaner exchange a glance, knowing something must be done."}
 _A7_C1F_["The nurse manages to hit the alarm button before the crew can subdue her."]
 _A9_(["Two armed cops await the crew when the elevator doors slide open."])
 _A9_1_(["Using the nurse as a human shield, they force the officers to back away."])
 _A9_2_(["The takedown is swift and messy, leaving Cleaner clutching a fresh gunshot wound."])
 _A9S_(["They flee without Cleaner, with the mission complete and the senator bound for a body bag."])
 _A2_C1P_["Assassin clamps chloroform over the nurse’s face, and within seconds, her body goes limp."]
 _A3_C2F_["Cleaner puts the nurse back in the closet, wedging the door shut with a chair."]
 _A3_4_(["As the crew heads to the elevator, a nurse passes by and enters the triage room."])
 _A3_5_(["She discovers her unconscious colleague and immediately calls for security."])
 _A3_6_(["With security tightened, the team decides to target the senator during his MRI scan."])
 _B3_(["The team sneaks into the waiting room, finding a young man waiting patiently."])
 _B3_C1_{"Imitator calmly informs him that his appointment is canceled."}
 _B3_C1F_["The patient insists he was told this was urgent and refuses to leave."]
 _B3_C2_{"Assassin and Cleaner conspire to eliminate the stubborn young man."}
 _B3_C2P_["Assassin knocks the kid out and Cleaner hides him in the bathroom."]
 _B4_(["The senator, who seems groggy and oblivious, is wheeled in by two police officers."])
 _B4_1_(["Impersonating a doctor, Imitator convinces them to wait outside and stand guard."])
 _B4_2_(["The radiographer comes out to prepare the senator and check him for metal items."])
 _B4_C1_{"Sensing an opportunity, Imitator urges the radiographer to begin the scan immediately."}
 _B4_C1P_["Posing as the senator&#39;s doctor, Imitator convinces him to activate the MRI scanner."]
 _B5_0_(["The radiographer reiterates that the senator must be screened for metal before entering."])
 _B5_(["Cleaner and Assassin check the senator for dangerous metal objects."])
 _B5_Cont_(["Noticing he&#39;s wearing his old military dog tags, Assassin devises a plan to conceal them."])
 _B5_C1_{"Cleaner and Assassin try to get the senator through with his tags hidden."}
 _B5_C1P_["Shielding the dog tags from view, they lead the senator toward the scan room."]
 _B6_(["The moment he steps in, the magnetic field drags the senator into the heart of the MRI machine."])
 _B6_1_(["His dog tag chain snaps taut under the magnet’s pull, carving into his neck like piano wire."])
 _B6_2_(["While the senator claws desperately at his throat, the technician tries to shut off the machine."])
 _B6_3_(["Imitator pretends to rush for help while the target is garroted by his own chain."])
 _B6S_(["With the senator slain in brutal fashion, the crew vanishes before the cops move in."])
 _C5_C1P_["Cleaner crosses two live wires, shorting the system and cutting power to the floor."]
 _C6_(["A violent jolt surges through Cleaner, flinging him backward."])
 _C6_C1_{"Imitator can&#39;t find the senator&#39;s IV in the dark, so he decides to improvise."}
 _C6_C1F_["Imitator tries to strangle him, but the senator kicks out and screams for help."]
 _C6_1_(["As the lights return, Imitator is caught with his hands around the senator&#39;s throat."])
 _C6F_(["Cops flood the ward as the crew flees, the hit job a failure and Imitator facing jail."])
 _A7_C1P_["A swift blood choke from Assassin drops the nurse without leaving a mark."]
 _A8_(["Cleaner props her body up in the corner as if she&#39;s dozed off while standing up."])
 _A8_1_(["The crew exits the hospital calmly, reuniting with Cat Burglar outside."])
 _A8S_(["Sirens wail as the crew leaves the scene, the senator having just taken his final breath."])
 _A6_C1P_["The senator exhales slowly, his vital signs dipping on the cardiac monitor."]
 _B5_C1F_["The radiographer overhears them sneaking past and insists on checking the senator himself."]
 _B5_1_(["He notices the dog tags and remonstrates with the crew, cursing their reckless oversight."])
 _B5_2_(["Imitator plays along, telling them they&#39;re fired from the senator&#39;s security detail."])
 _B5_3_(["As the radiographer examines the senator, Imitator considers his options."])
 _B5_4_(["Imitator finds a pair of trauma shears in the pocket of the stolen uniform."])
 _B5_5_(["With the senator&#39;s checks complete, Imitator steps forward to reassure him."])
 _B5_6_(["Imitator slips the shears down the back of the senator&#39;s briefs and shoves him forward."])
 _B5_7_(["The shears rip upward, penetrating the senator and dragging him into the scanner."])
 _B5_8_(["He screams wretchedly as the MRI&#39;s extreme magnetic force drives the implement deeper."])
 _B5_9_(["Several cops rush in as the technician tries to wrest the senator free, but it&#39;s too late."])
 _B5S_(["With the senator killed in excruciating fashion, the three crewmates are arrested for murder."])
 _C5_C2P_["Cat Burglar locates the breaker, and Cleaner twists two live wires to kill the power."]
 _B3_C1P_["The patient grumbles, mumbles a curse word, then leaves the MRI suite."]
 _A1_C1P_["Cat Burglar reaches a ledge and is able to shimmy across and enter through a window."]
 _A6_C2F_["Assassin delivers an overdose, sending the senator into instant cardiac arrest."]
 _A6_5_(["Assassin returns to his bed as the cop rushes to the senator&#39;s side."])
 _A6_6_(["Several more cops enter the room, and Imitator is urged to do something."])
 _A6_C3_{"Imitator grabs the defibrillator, dials the charge down, and shocks the senator’s chest."}
 _A6_C3F_["A nurse notices the low charge and grabs the paddles to take over."]
 _A6_12_(["As Imitator and the others sneak away, Assassin comes under immediate suspicion."])
 _A6_13_(["Cat Burglar makes it to the elevator but Cleaner is halted by a cop."])
 _A6_14_(["Unable to explain his presence on the floor, Cleaner is detained for questioning."])
 _A6F_(["The senator survives, and two crewmates are arrested on suspicion of the attempted hit."])
 _A3_C1P_["Cleaner removes a low wall vent and pushes the body into the narrow cavity behind."]
 _B4_C1F_["The technician brushes off Imitator, insisting that the senator&#39;s safety is paramount."]
 _B4_6_(["Imitator&#39;s persistence causes the radiographer to snap and call security."])
 _B4F_(["Imitator blows his cover and is arrested as the others flee, the senator left unharmed."])
 _C6_C1P_["Imitator smothers the senator with a pillow, holding it firm until he stops twitching."]
 _C7_(["In the blackout, the senator’s death goes undetected, allowing Imitator to escape."])
 _C7_1_(["The crew takes the stairs to leave, Assassin abandoning his wheelchair at the top."])
 _C7S_(["When power is restored, the senator’s death is revealed, his eyes fixed and unblinking."])
 _A6_C3P_["She delivers shock after shock as the senator’s heart remains flatlined."]
 _A6_7_(["Faking anxiety, Imitator hurries off, pretending to fetch help."])
 _A6_7_Cont_(["Cat Burglar and Cleaner follow her into the elevator."])
 _A6S_(["The crew escapes, Assassin kept for questioning as the senator lies dead beside him."])
 _B3_C2F_["The kid spots Assassin&#39;s move and starts shrieking loud enough to attract attention."]
 _B3F_(["The noise draws cops from the hallway, who take no chances and arrest everyone in the room."])
 _A2_C2F_["Assassin loses his grip on the nurse, allowing him to break out of the room."]
 _A2_8_(["As the nurse alerts security, Assassin rushes out to warn the others."])
 _A2_9_(["The team lay low in the staff locker room, waiting for the heat to pass."])
 _A2_10_(["Altering the plan, Assassin suggests ambushing the senator during his MRI scan."])
 _A2_11_(["Imitator grabs a nurse&#39;s uniform and changes before leading the crew across the corridor."])
 _A4_C2F_["A nurse catches Cat Burglar red-handed, and two cops step in to arrest her."]
 _A4F_(["With the police now on high alert, the team pulls out and calls off the assassination."])
 _A1_C3F_["Cat Burglar gets to the fourth floor, but slips again, crashing down onto Cleaner."]
 _A1_2_(["Cleaner is rendered unconscious and Cat Burglar has broken both of his ankles."])
 _A1F_(["With two teammates badly hurt, the crew ends up in the hospital for all the wrong reasons."])
 _A6_8_(["With cops blocking the elevator, Imitator and the others head to the records room."])
 _A6_9_(["Cat Burglar leads the crew out onto the ledge and down the drainpipe to escape."])
 _A6_10_(["Cleaner loses grip and falls, collapsing as his ankles snap beneath him."])
 _A6_11_(["Imitator and Cat Burglar help their stricken teammate to his feet."])

